<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Patterson shr target raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Patterson shr target raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities analyst Matt Conlon raised his target price on Patterson Energy Inc to $40 from $27, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst retained his buy rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- No further details were immediately available.</p>
</text>
